.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH xil-stem-log 1  "xil-stem-log " 
.SH NAME
xil\-stem\-log \- Parse xil\-pipeline logs into a stem generation chronology CSV.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBxil\-stem\-log\fR [\fB\-\-logs\-dir\fR] [\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-\-since\fR] [\fB\-\-episode\fR] [\fB\-\-slug\fR] [\fB\-\-show\fR] [\fB\-\-audit\fR] [\fB\-\-audit\-threshold\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Parse xil\-pipeline logs into a stem generation chronology CSV.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-logs\-dir\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Directory containing xil_YYYY\-MM\-DD.log files (default: <workspace>/logs/)
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fI<PATH>\fR [default: stem_log_report.csv]
Output CSV path (default: stem_log_report.csv); use \- for stdout
.TP
\fB\-\-since\fR \fI<YYYY\-MM\-DD>\fR
Only include log files on or after this date
.TP
\fB\-\-episode\fR \fI<TAG>\fR
Filter records to a specific episode tag (e.g. S03E03)
.TP
\fB\-\-slug\fR \fI<SLUG>\fR
Filter records to a specific show slug (e.g. the413)
.TP
\fB\-\-show\fR
Print CSV to stdout (equivalent to \-\-output \-)
.TP
\fB\-\-audit\fR \fI<PARSED_JSON>\fR
Instead of writing CSV: compare logged char_counts against the given parsed script JSON and flag stems whose audio may not match current text
.TP
\fB\-\-audit\-threshold\fR \fI<N>\fR [default: 20]
Char\-count delta threshold for \-\-audit flagging (default: 20)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
